00:07:07,160 --> 00:07:08,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When I take the initiative,</font>

182
00:07:08,800 --> 00:07:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it's partly because I like her.</font>

183
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But there's another really important factor.</font>

184
00:07:13,760 --> 00:07:14,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to be sure</font>

185
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">she already likes me.</font>

186
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're just like me.</font>

187
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:18,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

188
00:07:19,360 --> 00:07:21,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I once heard this saying.</font>

189
00:07:21,720 --> 00:07:23,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you take one step toward me,</font>

190
00:07:23,280 --> 00:07:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll take the other 99.</font>

191
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something like that.</font>

192
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. Same here.</font>

193
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I rarely make the first move.</font>

194
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But afterward,</font>

195
00:07:31,680 --> 00:07:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">once I'm sure,</font>

196
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">yeah,</font>

197
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:34,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm fine with anything.</font>

198
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

199
00:07:35,400 --> 00:07:36,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exactly.</font>

200
00:07:37,640 --> 00:07:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just in terms of looks, who do you like best?</font>

201
00:07:39,280 --> 00:07:40,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Which guy's appearance</font>

202
00:07:40,720 --> 00:07:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is closest to your ideal?</font>

203
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You.</font>

204
00:07:44,960 --> 00:07:45,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Looks-wise?</font>

205
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:46,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You.</font>

206
00:07:46,280 --> 00:07:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[You]</font>

207
00:07:47,080 --> 00:07:47,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

208
00:07:50,200 --> 00:07:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You.</font>

209
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:53,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Seriously.</font>

210
00:07:53,080 --> 00:07:53,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

211
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm very direct too. I'm serious.</font>

212
00:07:56,680 --> 00:07:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What about you?</font>

213
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:59,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't say me.</font>

214
00:07:59,320 --> 00:07:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You.</font>

215
00:07:59,720 --> 00:08:00,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

216
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:00,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You.</font>

217
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:01,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

218
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll be honest.</font>

219
00:08:04,640 --> 00:08:05,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's not you.</font>

220
00:08:06,560 --> 00:08:07,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who?</font>

221
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:11,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your roommate.</font>

222
00:08:11,160 --> 00:08:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi.</font>

223
00:08:11,760 --> 00:08:12,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

224
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:14,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Then why not choose her?]
Then why?</font>

225
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:15,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually,</font>

226
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:17,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">her looks and everything</font>

227
00:08:17,600 --> 00:08:19,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are the closest to...</font>

228
00:08:19,680 --> 00:08:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's practically...</font>

229
00:08:20,720 --> 00:08:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your dream girl.</font>

230
00:08:23,560 --> 00:08:24,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My dream girl. My ideal type. Yeah.</font>

231
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[His ideal type is Ren Chunxi]</font>

232
00:08:26,200 --> 00:08:27,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. Then why?</font>

233
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why?</font>

234
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:32,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's simple. In two days,</font>

235
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you can't know much about someone.</font>

236
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can't be that familiar. And...</font>

237
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:40,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She gives me the impression</font>

238
00:08:41,640 --> 00:08:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">of being very mature.</font>

239
00:08:43,040 --> 00:08:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm a little like a child.</font>

240
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:47,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think she's that mature.</font>

241
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think you need to fear that.</font>

242
00:08:49,360 --> 00:08:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not afraid.</font>

243
00:08:50,520 --> 00:08:51,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm just saying.</font>

244
00:08:51,440 --> 00:08:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's how I felt after talking to her.</font>

245
00:08:53,840 --> 00:08:54,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's all.</font>

246
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And I think...</font>

247
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:58,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've wanted to talk to you,</font>

248
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but never had the chance.</font>

249
00:08:59,720 --> 00:09:00,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I've wanted to talk to you but never had the chance]</font>

250
00:09:00,520 --> 00:09:01,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you want to talk to me?</font>

251
00:09:05,440 --> 00:09:06,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're so sunny</font>

252
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and outgoing.</font>

253
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I think you worry too much.</font>

254
00:09:12,040 --> 00:09:13,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If there's a girl you like,</font>

255
00:09:13,920 --> 00:09:15,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whose looks are your type,</font>

256
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">go for it.</font>

257
00:09:17,280 --> 00:09:18,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

258
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not avoiding her.</font>

259
00:09:19,880 --> 00:09:20,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just...</font>

260
00:09:20,280 --> 00:09:20,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

261
00:09:20,800 --> 00:09:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've only just arrived.</font>

262
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:25,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If there's still</font>

263
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">someone I want to talk to,</font>

264
00:09:27,760 --> 00:09:28,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can</font>

265
00:09:29,080 --> 00:09:30,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">try to find a chance.</font>

266
00:09:31,040 --> 00:09:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's all.</font>

267
00:09:33,440 --> 00:09:34,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you chose me today just because</font>

268
00:09:34,760 --> 00:09:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you hadn't had a chance to talk to me?</font>

269
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Checking again]</font>

270
00:09:37,360 --> 00:09:40,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[You're sunny and outgoing]
And you're really sunny and outgoing.</font>

271
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think that's...</font>

272
00:09:42,560 --> 00:09:43,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Something I really like]
Something I really like.</font>

273
00:09:43,760 --> 00:09:45,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Something I treasure]
I think it's really precious.</font>

274
00:09:46,080 --> 00:09:47,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sure.</font>

275
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go ahead.</font>

276
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you shooting here?</font>

277
00:09:49,240 --> 00:09:50,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. We're not shooting here.</font>

278
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're just sitting.</font>

279
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's sit over there.</font>

280
00:09:53,360 --> 00:09:54,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Okay. Let's sit for a bit.</font>

281
00:09:56,280 --> 00:09:57,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Why does she like me?]
Why does she like me?</font>

282
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because...</font>

283
00:10:00,480 --> 00:10:02,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

284
00:10:02,200 --> 00:10:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Am I your matchmaker now?</font>

285
00:10:05,160 --> 00:10:05,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

286
00:10:07,120 --> 00:10:09,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry. I shouldn't ask you.</font>

287
00:10:11,720 --> 00:10:12,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I just think...</font>

288
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She feels...</font>

289
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She really wants to get to know you.</font>

290
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just a feeling.</font>

291
00:10:18,480 --> 00:10:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. It's...</font>

292
00:10:19,800 --> 00:10:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Like how you feel about her.</font>

293
00:10:28,080 --> 00:10:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi, guys.</font>

294
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're finally done.</font>

295
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry to keep you waiting.</font>

296
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:32,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hi. You changed outfits.</font>

297
00:10:34,120 --> 00:10:35,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here comes your dream girl.</font>

298
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:39,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My buddy.</font>

299
00:10:39,000 --> 00:10:41,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why did you come in a T-shirt?</font>

300
00:10:41,640 --> 00:10:42,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should I wear long sleeves?</font>

301
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wear a shirt.</font>

302
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:46,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You should match your partner's outfit.</font>

303
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:47,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'll see if there's time to change.</font>

304
00:10:48,480 --> 00:10:49,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sorry to keep you waiting.</font>

305
00:10:54,520 --> 00:10:55,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After talking to me,</font>

306
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are you more sure</font>

307
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about choosing Xixi?</font>

308
00:11:00,480 --> 00:11:01,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why ask me that?</font>

309
00:11:02,760 --> 00:11:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I told you.</font>

310
00:11:06,040 --> 00:11:07,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Told me what?</font>

311
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I told you to go for it.</font>

312
00:11:09,240 --> 00:11:10,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You don't need to worry</font>

313
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:13,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">about how mature she is.</font>

314
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:20,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

315
00:11:21,240 --> 00:11:21,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

316
00:11:22,440 --> 00:11:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes.</font>

317
00:11:22,920 --> 00:11:25,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[He will choose Ren Chunxi firmly]</font>

318
00:11:25,680 --> 00:11:27,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then tell her yourself.</font>

319
00:11:34,560 --> 00:11:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you like her, why not make a move?</font>

320
00:11:37,320 --> 00:11:38,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is it because...</font>

321
00:11:38,880 --> 00:11:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you scared, or...?</font>

322
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:42,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here's the thing.</font>

323
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My ideal type</font>

324
00:11:44,480 --> 00:11:46,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is someone who looks</font>

325
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:48,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">like she wouldn't like me.</font>

326
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But yesterday she was so obvious.</font>

327
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:52,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. I only found out yesterday.</font>

328
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

329
00:11:53,360 --> 00:11:54,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I only found out last night.</font>

330
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yet today, you suddenly chose me.</font>

331
00:11:57,920 --> 00:11:58,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I thought...</font>

332
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:02,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came here</font>

333
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to work on something</font>

334
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:07,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've wanted to change for years.</font>

335
00:12:07,040 --> 00:12:09,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I keep telling myself...</font>

336
00:12:09,040 --> 00:12:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I'm so passive,</font>

337
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:12,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I'm just making excuses.</font>

338
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to change that.</font>

339
00:12:14,760 --> 00:12:16,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And get to know some girls.</font>

340
00:12:16,440 --> 00:12:17,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I didn't know</font>

341
00:12:17,280 --> 00:12:18,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I'd get another chance.</font>

342
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:21,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So when they announced the shoot,</font>

343
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I chose you.</font>

344
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:26,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then why, after we talked,</font>

345
00:12:26,040 --> 00:12:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were you suddenly</font>

346
00:12:28,160 --> 00:12:29,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so sure about choosing Xixi?</font>

347
00:12:34,120 --> 00:12:35,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's hard to say.</font>

348
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. Hard to explain.</font>

349
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:38,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hard to explain.</font>

350
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But there's also this idea.</font>

351
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:45,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When you're torn about something,</font>

352
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you get to know...</font>

353
00:12:46,960 --> 00:12:48,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say you get to know me,</font>

354
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or someone else,</font>

355
00:12:50,040 --> 00:12:50,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and then you realize</font>

356
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:52,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that being with that person</font>

357
00:12:52,880 --> 00:12:53,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">makes you</font>

358
00:12:54,240 --> 00:12:56,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more certain of what you want.</font>

359
00:12:56,400 --> 00:12:59,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You realize you're still sure</font>

360
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you like the person you liked before.</font>

