<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're sure about Xixi?</font>

1430
00:52:15,040 --> 00:52:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi or Ziyi?</font>

1431
00:52:17,200 --> 00:52:18,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Xixi.</font>

1432
00:52:18,360 --> 00:52:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sure about Ren Chunxi]
I'm sure about Xixi.</font>

1433
00:52:18,960 --> 00:52:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. Ren Chunxi.</font>

1434
00:52:20,560 --> 00:52:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let me tell you something, man.</font>

1435
00:52:22,440 --> 00:52:24,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're sure about Xixi?</font>

1436
00:52:24,320 --> 00:52:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1437
00:52:24,720 --> 00:52:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought today you might've</font>

1438
00:52:26,080 --> 00:52:27,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had more fun with Ziyi.</font>

1439
00:52:27,560 --> 00:52:29,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your photos were really sweet.</font>

1440
00:52:29,120 --> 00:52:29,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Man,</font>

1441
00:52:31,360 --> 00:52:33,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">photos are photos.</font>

1442
00:52:33,600 --> 00:52:34,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Getting along is a different thing.</font>

1443
00:52:34,920 --> 00:52:36,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Photos and getting along are different things]</font>

1444
00:52:36,720 --> 00:52:37,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So you feel...</font>

1445
00:52:37,360 --> 00:52:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A photo is just one moment.</font>

1446
00:52:37,880 --> 00:52:40,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You feel you enjoy</font>

1447
00:52:40,120 --> 00:52:41,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">spending time with Xixi more?</font>

1448
00:52:42,480 --> 00:52:43,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

1449
00:52:48,720 --> 00:52:51,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't explain the deeper reasons.</font>

1450
00:52:51,080 --> 00:52:51,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just...</font>

1451
00:52:52,280 --> 00:52:53,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With...</font>

1452
00:52:53,560 --> 00:52:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sit there. Sit there.</font>

1453
00:52:54,120 --> 00:52:55,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With Ren Chunxi,</font>

1454
00:52:56,080 --> 00:52:56,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel more relaxed.</font>

1455
00:52:57,840 --> 00:52:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dong.</font>

1456
00:52:58,520 --> 00:52:59,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1457
00:52:59,200 --> 00:53:00,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's talk, Dong.</font>

1458
00:53:00,280 --> 00:53:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I really need to...</font>

1459
00:53:01,080 --> 00:53:02,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I need to talk this through with you.</font>

1460
00:53:02,040 --> 00:53:03,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From an outsider's perspective,</font>

1461
00:53:03,560 --> 00:53:04,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">today I thought</font>

1462
00:53:04,320 --> 00:53:04,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">things between you and Ziyi</font>

1463
00:53:04,920 --> 00:53:07,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were really heating up.</font>

1464
00:53:07,200 --> 00:53:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think that's normal, because...</font>

1465
00:53:09,560 --> 00:53:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because...</font>

1466
00:53:12,480 --> 00:53:16,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wanted to talk to Cai Ziyi</font>

1467
00:53:16,600 --> 00:53:17,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">because we'd</font>

1468
00:53:17,920 --> 00:53:19,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">barely spoken.</font>

1469
00:53:19,560 --> 00:53:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right?</font>

1470
00:53:20,040 --> 00:53:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After talking today, I felt</font>

1471
00:53:22,120 --> 00:53:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're a little...</font>

1472
00:53:24,120 --> 00:53:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Our personalities clash a little.</font>

1473
00:53:26,080 --> 00:53:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honestly. She's very passive.</font>

1474
00:53:29,200 --> 00:53:30,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her past relationships</font>

1475
00:53:30,760 --> 00:53:32,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">are almost exactly like mine.</font>

1476
00:53:32,360 --> 00:53:35,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She needs someone</font>

1477
00:53:35,400 --> 00:53:37,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to actively lead the way</font>

1478
00:53:37,080 --> 00:53:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">before she can do the rest.</font>

1479
00:53:38,480 --> 00:53:40,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's exactly how I am.</font>

1480
00:53:41,560 --> 00:53:43,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think</font>

1481
00:53:43,040 --> 00:53:44,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in a relationship,</font>

1482
00:53:44,440 --> 00:53:46,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">being too similar</font>

1483
00:53:46,800 --> 00:53:48,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">in this way doesn't work.</font>

1484
00:53:48,240 --> 00:53:49,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You need someone complementary?</font>

1485
00:53:49,880 --> 00:53:51,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1486
00:53:51,040 --> 00:53:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. It's simple.</font>

1487
00:53:52,040 --> 00:53:53,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">After spending the day shooting together,</font>

1488
00:53:53,960 --> 00:53:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we finished the photos quickly.</font>

1489
00:53:55,080 --> 00:53:56,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We were done in an hour,</font>

1490
00:53:56,560 --> 00:53:57,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">then kept talking.</font>

1491
00:53:57,920 --> 00:53:58,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's just...</font>

1492
00:54:00,640 --> 00:54:01,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We can be friends.</font>

1493
00:54:01,040 --> 00:54:03,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I realized the feeling wasn't right.</font>

1494
00:54:03,760 --> 00:54:05,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I...</font>

1495
00:54:05,160 --> 00:54:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Relationships are often hard to explain.</font>

1496
00:54:06,960 --> 00:54:08,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I think the feeling matters.</font>

1497
00:54:08,120 --> 00:54:09,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Relatively speaking,</font>

1498
00:54:09,160 --> 00:54:09,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you and Xixi</font>

1499
00:54:09,760 --> 00:54:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">click better personality-wise.</font>

1500
00:54:12,240 --> 00:54:13,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. When we talk,</font>

1501
00:54:13,080 --> 00:54:14,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[More comfortable talking to Xixi]
we complement each other more.</font>

1502
00:54:14,640 --> 00:54:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The conversation feels more comfortable.</font>

1503
00:54:16,040 --> 00:54:17,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's it.</font>

1504
00:54:17,120 --> 00:54:18,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it's still early.</font>

1505
00:54:18,960 --> 00:54:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You've only known each other a few days.</font>

1506
00:54:22,440 --> 00:54:24,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, sometimes you meet someone</font>

1507
00:54:24,120 --> 00:54:24,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and the feeling's wrong.</font>

1508
00:54:24,560 --> 00:54:26,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Sometimes it just doesn't feel right]
You know it won't go any further.</font>

1509
00:54:26,160 --> 00:54:27,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's it.</font>

1510
00:54:27,800 --> 00:54:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But from what I saw,</font>

1511
00:54:31,680 --> 00:54:33,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you and Ziyi</font>

1512
00:54:33,320 --> 00:54:34,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">looked really sweet.</font>

1513
00:54:34,880 --> 00:54:35,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I mean is,</font>

1514
00:54:35,760 --> 00:54:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you need to tell Xixi.</font>

1515
00:54:38,000 --> 00:54:39,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Even I thought you looked sweet.</font>

1516
00:54:39,280 --> 00:54:40,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So imagine how Xixi felt.</font>

1517
00:54:40,360 --> 00:54:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's a little dead inside.</font>

1518
00:54:40,800 --> 00:54:42,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Completely shattered now.</font>

1519
00:54:43,080 --> 00:54:44,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">While I was watching you,</font>

1520
00:54:44,640 --> 00:54:46,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was looking at Xixi's face.</font>

1521
00:54:46,480 --> 00:54:48,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She looked like she was about to fall apart.</font>

1522
00:54:49,320 --> 00:54:50,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I said, since he likes it,</font>

1523
00:54:50,920 --> 00:54:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and it's rare for him to like a photo,</font>

1524
00:54:52,040 --> 00:54:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd go a little crazy with him.</font>

1525
00:54:55,360 --> 00:54:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This has such a lovely feel.</font>

1526
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:02,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought she was already crushed this morning.</font>

1527
00:55:02,720 --> 00:55:05,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No one gave her an invitation this morning.</font>

1528
00:55:05,760 --> 00:55:07,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was so thoughtless. Honestly.</font>

1529
00:55:07,160 --> 00:55:07,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm serious.</font>

1530
00:55:07,960 --> 00:55:09,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When we saw the sample photos,</font>

1531
00:55:09,080 --> 00:55:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">some of the guys and girls</font>

1532
00:55:10,360 --> 00:55:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">were just holding balloons far apart,</font>

1533
00:55:11,880 --> 00:55:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">happily taking photos.</font>

1534
00:55:12,960 --> 00:55:14,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing intimate.</font>

1535
00:55:14,320 --> 00:55:15,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So we wanted</font>

1536
00:55:15,760 --> 00:55:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to just have fun with it today.</font>

1537
00:55:17,040 --> 00:55:19,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But photos need some interaction.</font>

1538
00:55:19,040 --> 00:55:22,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The simplest interaction is just</font>

1539
00:55:22,200 --> 00:55:22,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">resting a hand on someone.</font>

1540
00:55:22,920 --> 00:55:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We smiled, and the photos looked quite...</font>

1541
00:55:24,720 --> 00:55:26,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You looked really happy.</font>

1542
00:55:26,080 --> 00:55:26,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Listen.</font>

1543
00:55:26,680 --> 00:55:28,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The reason I thought it was sweet</font>

1544
00:55:28,160 --> 00:55:29,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is that everyone thinks</font>

1545
00:55:29,200 --> 00:55:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you're a very aloof person.</font>

1546
00:55:30,640 --> 00:55:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Today might be the first time</font>

1547
00:55:32,320 --> 00:55:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they've seen this side of you.</font>

1548
00:55:34,480 --> 00:55:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was happy taking the photos.</font>

1549
00:55:36,200 --> 00:55:37,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't talk much otherwise.</font>

1550
00:55:37,760 --> 00:55:39,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But people won't think</font>

1551
00:55:39,040 --> 00:55:40,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we coached you into acting like that.</font>

1552
00:55:40,600 --> 00:55:41,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They might think</font>

1553
00:55:41,480 --> 00:55:42,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">spending time with Ziyi</font>

1554
00:55:42,920 --> 00:55:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">made you open up.</font>

1555
00:55:44,040 --> 00:55:45,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">From an outsider's perspective,</font>

1556
00:55:45,880 --> 00:55:46,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ziyi opened your heart</font>

1557
00:55:46,960 --> 00:55:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and made you</font>

1558
00:55:47,960 --> 00:55:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so much more outgoing.</font>

1559
00:55:50,160 --> 00:55:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To Xixi, it looks like</font>

1560
00:55:51,800 --> 00:55:53,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">another girl has found her way into your heart</font>

1561
00:55:53,000 --> 00:55:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and opened it up.</font>

1562
00:55:54,040 --> 00:55:54,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wouldn't Xixi</font>

1563
00:55:54,520 --> 00:55:55,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be completely devastated?</font>

1564
00:55:55,720 --> 00:55:56,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it were me...</font>

1565
00:55:56,680 --> 00:55:58,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't know you still felt that way.</font>

1566
00:55:58,920 --> 00:56:00,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I were Xixi,</font>

1567
00:56:00,280 --> 00:56:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd already have been crushed this morning.</font>

1568
00:56:01,840 --> 00:56:02,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why explain? It's so deliberate.</font>

1569
00:56:02,520 --> 00:56:04,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, she didn't get an invitation.</font>

1570
00:56:04,080 --> 00:56:05,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then you went to find her.</font>

1571
00:56:05,200 --> 00:56:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She thought you were giving her one.</font>

1572
00:56:06,960 --> 00:56:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1573
00:56:07,840 --> 00:56:09,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You got her hopes up, then let her down.</font>

1574
00:56:09,800 --> 00:56:10,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1575
00:56:10,440 --> 00:56:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Really?</font>

1576
00:56:10,800 --> 00:56:12,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought explaining would help.</font>

1577
00:56:12,160 --> 00:56:13,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought you no longer</font>

1578
00:56:13,240 --> 00:56:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">felt that way about Xixi.</font>

1579
00:56:14,560 --> 00:56:16,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why you acted like that.</font>

1580
00:56:16,160 --> 00:56:16,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

1581
00:56:17,800 --> 00:56:19,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought comforting her first</font>

1582
00:56:19,080 --> 00:56:19,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">would make her feel better.</font>

1583
00:56:19,760 --> 00:56:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

1584
00:56:20,480 --> 00:56:22,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What I meant was, in my mind,</font>

1585
00:56:22,120 --> 00:56:23,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Considering Xixi's feelings]
I was thinking of your feelings.</font>

1586
00:56:23,880 --> 00:56:25,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why I came to you first.</font>

1587
00:56:25,760 --> 00:56:26,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But for me,</font>

1588
00:56:26,280 --> 00:56:26,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if I were Xixi,</font>

1589
00:56:26,960 --> 00:56:27,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">from her perspective,</font>

1590
00:56:27,600 --> 00:56:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you asked me to come outside,</font>

1591
00:56:29,520 --> 00:56:30,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and last night,</font>

1592
00:56:30,200 --> 00:56:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we'd had a pretty good chat.</font>

1593
00:56:32,400 --> 00:56:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you called me out today,</font>

1594
00:56:33,240 --> 00:56:34,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">surely you'd be giving me an invitation.</font>

1595
00:56:34,280 --> 00:56:36,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She might've</font>

1596
00:56:36,000 --> 00:56:37,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">had that expectation, I think.</font>

1597
00:56:37,800 --> 00:56:38,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I've messed up again.</font>

1598
00:56:38,840 --> 00:56:41,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel like I ruined two people's moods.</font>

1599
00:56:41,720 --> 00:56:42,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Blaming himself]
You haven't done anything bad.</font>

1600
00:56:42,840 --> 00:56:44,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think your personality...</font>

1601
00:56:44,040 --> 00:56:45,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You take things slowly.</font>

1602
00:56:45,600 --> 00:56:47,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And deep down,</font>

1603
00:56:47,960 --> 00:56:48,480
