<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He asked, "Should I put it back?"</font>

2126
01:13:41,040 --> 01:13:42,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Put it back.</font>

2127
01:13:45,320 --> 01:13:47,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[One too hot, one too cold]
One's too hot. One's too cold.</font>

2128
01:13:48,080 --> 01:13:49,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Girl, I can't handle this.</font>

2129
01:13:49,680 --> 01:13:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Forget it. I'm giving up.</font>

2130
01:13:58,120 --> 01:14:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Attention, all islanders.</font>

2131
01:14:00,160 --> 01:14:01,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The Moon of Affection is now lit.</font>

2132
01:14:03,520 --> 01:14:05,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Please go to the Moon of Affection</font>

2133
01:14:05,240 --> 01:14:07,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for today's affection voting.</font>

2134
01:14:07,840 --> 01:14:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every feeling flows like moonlight.</font>

2135
01:14:10,360 --> 01:14:12,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Every affection makes the moon more complete.</font>

2136
01:14:12,880 --> 01:14:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For whom does the full moon rise in your heart?</font>

2137
01:14:15,680 --> 01:14:18,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Affection voting begins: Five Moonstones today]</font>

2138
01:14:22,840 --> 01:14:25,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shuyue to Gao: Two Moonstones]
I gave Gao Yuheng two Moonstones.</font>

2139
01:14:25,320 --> 01:14:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Shuyue to Yang: Two Moonstones]
Two to Huang Siyang.</font>

2140
01:14:27,320 --> 01:14:28,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I've talked to those two</font>

2141
01:14:28,960 --> 01:14:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">more than the others.</font>

2142
01:14:30,560 --> 01:14:32,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They both have lovely personalities,</font>

2143
01:14:32,240 --> 01:14:33,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">so I gave them my votes.</font>

2144
01:14:37,000 --> 01:14:38,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tobe Lei to Ren Chunxi: Two Moonstones]</font>

2145
01:14:38,640 --> 01:14:39,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tobe Lei to Zhang Yi: Two Moonstones]</font>

2146
01:14:39,620 --> 01:14:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Tobe Lei to Qian Shihan: Two Moonstones]</font>

2147
01:14:44,600 --> 01:14:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hu Ke'er: How did you vote the first two times?]</font>

2148
01:14:45,560 --> 01:14:46,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zheng Shoudong: Want to know?]</font>

2149
01:14:46,840 --> 01:14:47,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Hu Ke'er: Tell me]</font>

2150
01:14:47,600 --> 01:14:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zheng Shoudong: I gave you all of mine both times]</font>

2151
01:14:52,440 --> 01:14:53,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It wasn't quite...</font>

2152
01:14:53,680 --> 01:14:54,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wasn't quite what?</font>

2153
01:14:55,080 --> 01:14:57,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Giving you only three on day one felt a little...</font>

2154
01:14:57,760 --> 01:15:00,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Guilty]
It's okay.</font>

2155
01:15:00,160 --> 01:15:01,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm still here, aren't I?</font>

2156
01:15:02,200 --> 01:15:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm still here.</font>

2157
01:15:03,200 --> 01:15:04,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't think that's the same thing.</font>

2158
01:15:04,720 --> 01:15:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're still here because</font>

2159
01:15:07,040 --> 01:15:08,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ally chose you.</font>

2160
01:15:08,440 --> 01:15:12,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But it feels like I indirectly...</font>

2161
01:15:13,040 --> 01:15:14,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Caused me to leave the island?</font>

2162
01:15:14,000 --> 01:15:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2163
01:15:15,320 --> 01:15:15,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

2164
01:15:15,720 --> 01:15:18,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I wondered if day one was a little too...</font>

2165
01:15:18,080 --> 01:15:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So...</font>

2166
01:15:18,800 --> 01:15:20,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's okay.</font>

2167
01:15:21,960 --> 01:15:23,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If it's about affection,</font>

2168
01:15:23,920 --> 01:15:26,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I honestly want to give all of mine to one person.</font>

2169
01:15:26,440 --> 01:15:29,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But there are still competitions and all that.</font>

2170
01:15:29,840 --> 01:15:30,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I felt</font>

2171
01:15:30,880 --> 01:15:32,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I couldn't read</font>

2172
01:15:33,320 --> 01:15:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">everyone's intentions.</font>

2173
01:15:34,320 --> 01:15:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I didn't know if everyone just wanted</font>

2174
01:15:35,880 --> 01:15:36,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to win.</font>

2175
01:15:36,560 --> 01:15:38,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. To win and stay on the island.</font>

2176
01:15:38,560 --> 01:15:40,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why they were doing it.</font>

2177
01:15:40,240 --> 01:15:42,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But now, I don't really want</font>

2178
01:15:42,520 --> 01:15:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to overthink it anymore.</font>

2179
01:15:44,000 --> 01:15:45,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I think,</font>

2180
01:15:45,000 --> 01:15:46,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">whether I win or lose,</font>

2181
01:15:46,720 --> 01:15:47,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want</font>

2182
01:15:48,920 --> 01:15:51,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to go against my heart</font>

2183
01:15:51,800 --> 01:15:53,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and make choices I'm only half happy with.</font>

2184
01:15:53,880 --> 01:15:55,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's why I gave you all of mine yesterday.</font>

2185
01:15:55,880 --> 01:15:57,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was really torn yesterday.</font>

2186
01:15:57,280 --> 01:15:58,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Should I give you all of them?</font>

2187
01:15:58,680 --> 01:16:01,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Would that be too much on day two?</font>

2188
01:16:02,560 --> 01:16:03,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Because I do...</font>

2189
01:16:03,440 --> 01:16:05,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still weigh up the pros and cons.</font>

2190
01:16:05,480 --> 01:16:06,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To put it bluntly,</font>

2191
01:16:06,960 --> 01:16:08,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still weigh things up.</font>

2192
01:16:08,200 --> 01:16:09,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I completely understand.</font>

2193
01:16:09,240 --> 01:16:10,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah.</font>

2194
01:16:10,280 --> 01:16:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But in the end, I thought</font>

2195
01:16:11,760 --> 01:16:15,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd follow</font>

2196
01:16:15,480 --> 01:16:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my feelings at that moment.</font>

2197
01:16:15,960 --> 01:16:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. My first instinct.</font>

2198
01:16:17,320 --> 01:16:19,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought, "Forget it. All of them."</font>

2199
01:16:19,640 --> 01:16:20,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Worst case, I leave.</font>

2200
01:16:20,920 --> 01:16:22,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go out in style.</font>

2201
01:16:23,440 --> 01:16:24,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Live life in style.</font>

2202
01:16:26,440 --> 01:16:28,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Without hesitation]
Don't even need to look.</font>

2203
01:16:28,240 --> 01:16:29,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My vote is very simple.</font>

2204
01:16:30,560 --> 01:16:31,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zheng Shoudong to Hu Ke'er: Five Moonstones]</font>

2205
01:16:31,680 --> 01:16:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">All of them.</font>

2206
01:16:35,760 --> 01:16:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just go all in.</font>

2207
01:16:36,800 --> 01:16:39,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's put her full trust in me too.</font>

2208
01:16:39,240 --> 01:16:40,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On our third day,</font>

2209
01:16:40,640 --> 01:16:42,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're giving everything to each other.</font>

2210
01:16:42,720 --> 01:16:44,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I think...</font>

2211
01:16:44,760 --> 01:16:46,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We're definitely giving each other all five.</font>

2212
01:16:46,000 --> 01:16:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On day three,</font>

2213
01:16:48,800 --> 01:16:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I still gave him all of mine.</font>

2214
01:16:51,240 --> 01:16:54,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've had some really serious talks.</font>

2215
01:16:54,240 --> 01:16:56,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think in some ways,</font>

2216
01:16:56,280 --> 01:16:57,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we're quite compatible.</font>

2217
01:16:57,640 --> 01:16:58,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So I thought</font>

2218
01:16:58,880 --> 01:17:00,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'd give him all of mine again.</font>

2219
01:17:04,280 --> 01:17:05,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">They asked me</font>

2220
01:17:05,560 --> 01:17:08,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">what I'd want to do on a date.</font>

2221
01:17:08,480 --> 01:17:10,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The first thing</font>

2222
01:17:10,120 --> 01:17:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that came to mind was taking a walk.</font>

2223
01:17:11,880 --> 01:17:14,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[A walk is his ideal date]
They thought that was old-fashioned.</font>

2224
01:17:14,880 --> 01:17:16,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But why do I like walks?</font>

2225
01:17:16,120 --> 01:17:18,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">First, I don't like being on my phone.</font>

2226
01:17:18,280 --> 01:17:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't like replying to messages.</font>

2227
01:17:21,160 --> 01:17:22,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I like talking face to face.</font>

2228
01:17:25,280 --> 01:17:25,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think,</font>

2229
01:17:25,960 --> 01:17:28,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">after how we've spent these two days,</font>

2230
01:17:28,600 --> 01:17:30,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a real conversation is essential.</font>

2231
01:17:30,800 --> 01:17:34,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've only been together</font>

2232
01:17:34,160 --> 01:17:35,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">doing everyday things.</font>

2233
01:17:35,120 --> 01:17:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We haven't really</font>

2234
01:17:36,200 --> 01:17:40,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">shared what's in our hearts</font>

2235
01:17:40,000 --> 01:17:40,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or talked about</font>

2236
01:17:40,800 --> 01:17:42,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our views on things.</font>

2237
01:17:43,040 --> 01:17:44,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So companionship, love and money.</font>

2238
01:17:44,720 --> 01:17:45,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How would you rank them?</font>

2239
01:17:46,800 --> 01:17:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Rank companionship, love and money]
When they asked me things like that,</font>

2240
01:17:49,280 --> 01:17:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I felt they were fifty-fifty.</font>

2241
01:17:51,240 --> 01:17:52,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Equal shares]
Everything's fifty-fifty.</font>

2242
01:17:52,840 --> 01:17:54,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. I think</font>

2243
01:17:55,480 --> 01:17:57,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when you gain something,</font>

2244
01:17:57,440 --> 01:17:58,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you have to</font>

2245
01:17:58,120 --> 01:17:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lose something too.</font>

2246
01:17:59,440 --> 01:18:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What if you had to rank these three?</font>

2247
01:18:03,120 --> 01:18:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Companionship, love and money.</font>

2248
01:18:07,120 --> 01:18:08,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's hard.</font>

2249
01:18:09,120 --> 01:18:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I basically never think about that.</font>

2250
01:18:12,920 --> 01:18:15,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't you have your own thoughts</font>

2251
01:18:15,080 --> 01:18:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or opinions?</font>

2252
01:18:17,040 --> 01:18:17,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How do I put it?</font>

2253
01:18:17,680 --> 01:18:19,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Maybe I've never faced anything</font>

2254
01:18:21,440 --> 01:18:22,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that really needed me to take a stand.</font>

2255
01:18:22,760 --> 01:18:24,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Something that crossed my bottom line,</font>

2256
01:18:24,200 --> 01:18:25,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">where I had to</font>

2257
01:18:25,440 --> 01:18:28,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">be completely firm.</font>

2258
01:18:28,840 --> 01:18:29,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Absolutely firm.</font>

2259
01:18:29,520 --> 01:18:31,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But you're a Judging type.</font>

2260
01:18:31,120 --> 01:18:32,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. I'm a Judging type.</font>

2261
01:18:32,560 --> 01:18:33,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But when it comes to...</font>

2262
01:18:33,440 --> 01:18:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Shouldn't a Judging type</font>

2263
01:18:34,320 --> 01:18:36,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have a strong sense of order?</font>

2264
01:18:36,280 --> 01:18:37,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I do, but...</font>

2265
01:18:38,880 --> 01:18:40,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">For me,</font>

2266
01:18:40,040 --> 01:18:41,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think I'm someone</font>

2267
01:18:41,800 --> 01:18:42,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">with very clear opinions.</font>

2268
01:18:42,560 --> 01:18:44,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yeah. I have my own ideas.</font>

2269
01:18:44,320 --> 01:18:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And sometimes,</font>

2270
01:18:47,160 --> 01:18:50,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a conversation helps me discover</font>

2271
01:18:50,040 --> 01:18:52,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Getting to know each other more deeply]
a deeper side of someone.</font>

2272
01:18:54,680 --> 01:18:55,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you voted with your Moonstones?</font>

2273
01:18:55,960 --> 01:18:57,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. Have you finished?</font>

2274
01:18:57,160 --> 01:18:58,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I went to talk.</font>

2275
01:18:58,840 --> 01:19:00,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How far have you got?</font>

2276
01:19:00,440 --> 01:19:03,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He said he gave me all of his both days.</font>

2277
01:19:03,040 --> 01:19:03,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

2278
01:19:03,640 --> 01:19:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think he did.</font>

2279
01:19:07,480 --> 01:19:08,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the kind of couple I love watching.</font>

2280
01:19:08,560 --> 01:19:10,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Being direct, right?</font>

2281
01:19:10,720 --> 01:19:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">In yesterday's game too,</font>

2282
01:19:12,040 --> 01:19:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he said he's only interested in one person.</font>

2283
01:19:14,400 --> 01:19:16,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[I can't stand it]
I can't stand it.</font>

2284
01:19:18,320 --> 01:19:19,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Envious]</font>

2285
01:19:23,280 --> 01:19:24,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Actually, I should</font>

2286
01:19:24,280 --> 01:19:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">write my name backward.</font>

2287
01:19:25,880 --> 01:19:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I could do this.</font>

2288
01:19:27,240 --> 01:19:29,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you trying to do?</font>

2289
01:19:30,680 --> 01:19:31,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

2290
01:19:31,400 --> 01:19:32,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">One moment.</font>

2291
01:19:32,680 --> 01:19:33,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Helping]
What's wrong?</font>

2292
01:19:33,560 --> 01:19:35,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What is it now, my lady?</font>

2293
01:19:39,840 --> 01:19:41,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My lady.</font>

2294
01:19:53,320 --> 01:19:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Zhenyu to Xinran: Five Moonstones]
My feelings haven't really changed.</font>

2295
01:19:55,760 --> 01:19:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's still...</font>

